      R. Q. 3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِصْعَنْرَرَ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِصْعَرَّرَ</span>, (K,) in which
latter the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is incorporated into the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ر</span>, (TA,) <i>He</i>
(being beaten or struck) <i>writhed,</i> (TA,) <i>and
turned round by reason of pain, in his place, and
became contracted.</i> (K, TA.)

